@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
state "待放行" as Pending
state "可用" as Ready
state "已发放待确认" as Issued
state "已使用" as Used
state "隔离" as Isolated
[*] --> Pending : 建立本轮包次\n[属于本轮处理]\n/ 保留包装及期限
Pending --> Ready : 接受本轮放行\n[处理已放行且本包有效]\n/ 允许发放
Ready --> Issued : 登记发放\n[本轮未使用且实物核对通过]\n/ 关联待使用就诊
Issued --> Used : 登记实际使用\n[实际使用已确认]\n/ 保留就诊与本轮关联
Issued --> Ready : 确认未用退回\n[未使用且实物仍有效]\n/ 保留退回经历
Ready --> Isolated : 停止后续正常使用\n[异常或过期]\n/ 禁止发放
Issued --> Isolated : 停止后续正常使用\n[异常或实物不明]\n/ 保留发放关联
Used : 提供历史追溯 [批次后续异常]\n/ 保留原使用并形成追查

@enduml
